OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of
OL,6,Frain, perhaps heavy and thundery,
OL,7,Feasing away north during the evening,
OL,8,Fbut a few showers continuing across
OL,9,Fhills. Further showers likely to
OL,10,Fspread north towards dawn, perhaps
OL,11,Fheavy and thundery in the far
OL,12,Fsoutheast.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FCloudy with further outbreaks
OL,15,Fof rain, perhaps heavy and persistent
OL,16,Fat times. Greatest risk along the east
OL,17,Fcoast at first, but anywhere by
OL,18,Fafternoon. Some parts perhaps staying
OL,19,Fdry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
